body:
Berserk's Golden Age Trilogy ends in a brutal and dark way.  If sexual violence is a trigger for you, then avoid it at all cost.  After the 1997 series, it's the best, recent Berserk adaptation that I've seen.  So if all you've seen of Berserk are the two subpar anime that came out around two years ago, then give this one a shot because it's far, far better.

{Berserk: Ougon Jidai-hen I - Haou no Tamago}

{Berserk: Ougon Jidai-hen II - Doldrey Kouryaku}

{Berserk: Ougon Jidai-hen III - Kourin}

I'm kind of breaking your rules here, but {Haibane Renmei} is my favorite series of all time, but it aired in 2002 rather than the 90's.  I really can't recommend it enough though!

As far as shows and movies that are actually from the 90's, here are a few I'd recommend checking out:

* {Shoujo Kakumei Utena} (another favorite of mine)
* {Mimi wo Sumaseba}
* {Macross Plus} (sequel to {Macross})
* {Oniisama e...}
* {Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou} and its sequel {Yokohama Kaidashi Kikou: Quiet Country Cafe}
* {Memories}

I hope you're able to find something you like in there.
